\spheader 272Yh\dvAformerly{2{}72Ya}  Develop a theory of independence
for random variables taking values in $\BbbR^r$, following through as
many as possible of the ideas of this section.
}%end of exercises

\endnotes{

target_text:
\spheader 272Yh\dvAformerly{2{}72Ya} Kembangkan teori kebebasan untuk
variabel acak yang mengambil nilai dalam $\BbbR^r$, dengan menelusuri
sebanyak mungkin gagasan seksi ini.
}%end of exercises

